{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/c4a46510f886ae1bc4941468de5c6f94.avif?t=1773618151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/c4a46510f886ae1bc4941468de5c6f94.webp?t=1773618151 width=1560 height=658 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Creation</u></strong><br><br><br><br>Before you hop into a game you must select your dinosaur, which you will customize to your liking.<br>Each dinosaur begins with <strong>3 core abilities</strong> and then throughout the match, you will advance your evolutionary traits by gaining Evolution Points. These are found through Evolution Spires littered through the map or by eliminating other players.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/a9334d04bcaca38cf80d09b849623515.avif?t=1773618151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/a9334d04bcaca38cf80d09b849623515.webp?t=1773618151 width=1560 height=639 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>The Battle For Dominance</u></strong><br>You may find trails of other opponents, you will use these to track down and fight other dinosaurs. Every battle is extremely unforgiving so be careful with how you ambush who you are after. One wrong move and you may find yourself <strong>extinct.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/9b94c32e17662d44997e14ab88b1c4a6.avif?t=1773618151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/9b94c32e17662d44997e14ab88b1c4a6.avif?t=1773618151 width=800 height=334 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Exploration</u></strong><br>The island is your hunting ground, get to know it well.<br>The Island is home to many biomes, from arid badlands to lush spruce forests, to underground labyrinths like the Biolume Caverns. <br>Explore carefully, as the match progresses, a ring of flames, The Firestorm will constantly have you on the move and moved closer to other dinosaurs.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/188472c8db7b0df193344d662eb0a453.avif?t=1773618151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/188472c8db7b0df193344d662eb0a453.webp?t=1773618151 width=1560 height=759 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Progression\u00a0</u></strong><br>Every match will prove with rewards, experience and rank will be rewarded based on performance. <br>Leveling up your dinosaur will grant you new colors and\u00a0customizations. Letting you make it truly yours. <br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>A True Test Of Survival\u00a0</u></strong><br><strong>The Time Forgotten</strong>\u00a0is a hardcore Battle Royale set on a massive forgotten Island, where YOU play as a Dinosaur.  <br>Fight for survival against other players in a brutal struggle for victory. The ecosystem is actively working against you in your fight for survival so be cautious as other dinosaurs are not your only worry on this forsaken island.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3279760?t=1773618151","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/bcbac0daa40f31b2a99d7202531da43f2779c009/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773618151","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/d819a3d5baf3ed41c1265c08db25c75d5720df45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773618151","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/d819a3d5baf3ed41c1265c08db25c75d5720df45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773618151","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/c4a46510f886ae1bc4941468de5c6f94.avif?t=1773618151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/c4a46510f886ae1bc4941468de5c6f94.webp?t=1773618151 width=1560 height=658 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Creation</u></strong><br><br><br><br>Before you hop into a game you must select your dinosaur, which you will customize to your liking.<br>Each dinosaur begins with <strong>3 core abilities</strong> and then throughout the match, you will advance your evolutionary traits by gaining Evolution Points. These are found through Evolution Spires littered through the map or by eliminating other players.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/a9334d04bcaca38cf80d09b849623515.avif?t=1773618151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/a9334d04bcaca38cf80d09b849623515.webp?t=1773618151 width=1560 height=639 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>The Battle For Dominance</u></strong><br>You may find trails of other opponents, you will use these to track down and fight other dinosaurs. Every battle is extremely unforgiving so be careful with how you ambush who you are after. One wrong move and you may find yourself <strong>extinct.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/9b94c32e17662d44997e14ab88b1c4a6.avif?t=1773618151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/9b94c32e17662d44997e14ab88b1c4a6.avif?t=1773618151 width=800 height=334 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Exploration</u></strong><br>The island is your hunting ground, get to know it well.<br>The Island is home to many biomes, from arid badlands to lush spruce forests, to underground labyrinths like the Biolume Caverns. <br>Explore carefully, as the match progresses, a ring of flames, The Firestorm will constantly have you on the move and moved closer to other dinosaurs.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/188472c8db7b0df193344d662eb0a453.avif?t=1773618151\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/188472c8db7b0df193344d662eb0a453.webp?t=1773618151 width=1560 height=759 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Progression\u00a0</u></strong><br>Every match will prove with rewards, experience and rank will be rewarded based on performance. <br>Leveling up your dinosaur will grant you new colors and\u00a0customizations. Letting you make it truly yours. <br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>A True Test Of Survival\u00a0</u></strong><br><strong>The Time Forgotten</strong>\u00a0is a hardcore Battle Royale set on a massive forgotten Island, where YOU play as a Dinosaur.  <br>Fight for survival against other players in a brutal struggle for victory. The ecosystem is actively working against you in your fight for survival so be cautious as other dinosaurs are not your only worry on this forsaken island.</p></li></ul>","developers":["DracoTEK"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/f9999a384424067b2c604a688e9c13f03d6c16b6/header.jpg?t=1773618151","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Time Forgotten","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</stro